Pareto log cumulative distribution function.

  JAX implementation of :obj:`scipy.stats.pareto` ``logcdf``.

  The Pareto cumulative distribution function is given by

  .. math::

     F(x, b) = \begin{cases}
       1 - x^{-b} & x \ge 1\\
       0 & x < 1
     \end{cases}

  and is defined for :math:`b > 0`.

